WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:03.370
Get running, get running

3
00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:06.460
holding our flag high in the sky

4
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:18.060
Cross this endless sea with me and search for

5
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.810
a global miracle no one

6
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.940
has yet been able to find

7
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.960
With our hearts pounding,

8
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.710
we'll just charge ahead as we please, following

9
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:35.590
the footprints of those who pursue their dreams

10
00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.390
No matter how stormy the night,

11
00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.390
if we put our minds together,

12
00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.540
we'll get through it

13
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:47.860
always

14
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.590
Get running, get running

15
00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:54.550
holding our flag high in the sky

16
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.140
Even though there are tears

17
00:00:57.230 --> 00:01:00.580
we don't want anyone to see

18
00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.520
Keep chasing, keep chasing

19
00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:06.520
the compass that leads to our dreams

20
00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.230
always points straight ahead

21
00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.400
We can't stop here

22
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.490
Get running, get running,

23
00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:24.540
head past everyone else

24
00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.120
So long as we don't run from it,

25
00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:30.540
we can take hold of tomorrow

26
00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.630
Keep chasing, keep chasing

27
00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.510
everything we see in the moment,

28
00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.930
we should record it all

29
00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:41.430
in the blank slates of our minds

30
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:52.860
Th...

31
00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.090
Th-This can't be happening!

32
00:01:55.510 --> 00:02:00.140
CP9's leader, Mr. Rob Lucci, is considered to be the most powerful agent...

33
00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:04.100
in the history of Cipher Pol.

34
00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:10.060
<b>Utter Defeat</b>

35
00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.410
His defeat at the hands of a mere pirate is unbelievable!

36
00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.460
Luffy won!

37
00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.100
He had me on pins and needles there.

38
00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.520
So you finally did it, Straw Hat!

39
00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.190
Luffy!

40
00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.690
Everyone, hurry to the ship!
We're gonna set sail!

41
00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.860
You did it! Luffy!

42
00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:03.870
You did it, Straw Hat!

43
00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:08.290
Y-You morons! The Navy will hear us!

44
00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.260
That's okay! Let them hear!

45
00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.170
Hey! Who's saying that?!

46
00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:16.910
Unknown! They're transmitting
via transponder snail!

47
00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:19.130
Big Bro!

48
00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:28.530
What is this voice?!

49
00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:44.470
Shut yer mouth! If only we'd taken off,
the Navy would've thought we died!

50
00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:45.910
You guys!

51
00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:47.700
Those guys!

52
00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:55.270
What's the likelihood they're the same pirates
we eliminated at the main gate?

53
00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:59.200
Well, I don't see how.
I'm sure they all fell off the cliff!

54
00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.850
There's no way they could've survived.

55
00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:11.730
Dammit! It's cannon fire!

56
00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.640
Big Bro!

57
00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.070
Hey, idiot! Don't push!

58
00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:55.770
Don't move!

59
00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:56.620
We're gonna fall!

60
00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:57.680
The ropes are gonna rip!

61
00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.610
You morons! Galley-La's ropes never break!

62
00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:04.040
Sheesh, I already toldya to keep yer mouth shut.

63
00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:07.270
We're all okay!

64
00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:10.970
The giants blocked us from the cannon fire!

65
00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.770
Whoa! They're undeniably tenacious.

66
00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:18.210
Grandma! They're all alive!

67
00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:21.350
Sodom and Gomorrah are gonna make it too!

68
00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:22.670
I'm so glad to hear that!

69
00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.930
But if we stick around here,
the battleships are sure to come back.

70
00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.320
Let's get the hell outta here!

71
00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:33.430
Oh, and we have a means of escape,
so don't worry about us!

72
00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:34.910
Let's meet up after we get out alive!

73
00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:36.030
That's right!

74
00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:37.190
Let's hurry!

75
00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:40.440
You guys gonna climb, or what?

76
00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:43.370
The blood is rushing up to my head!

77
00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:45.360
No, it's rushing down!

78
00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.850
Okay, climb up!

79
00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.180
Climb up slowly!

80
00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.540
We're gonna fall!

81
00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.160
Don't shake!

82
00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:57.320
You stupid... jerks!

83
00:05:57.320 --> 00:06:01.340
You guys think I was worried? You dumbasses!

84
00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:07.310
Those numbskulls are alive!
I... I couldn't be happier! What a relief!

85
00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.990
Yeah. No denying it's a relief,

86
00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:16.630
but it'd be a waste if you died here, right?

87
00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.810
Yeah. You're right.

88
00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:24.030
Should we head over to the main gate right away?!

89
00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.630
Later. For now, we should focus our efforts here.

90
00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:31.030
What're you all doing?!
Carry out your orders already!

91
00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:32.490
Yes, sir!

92
00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:40.790
Hey! Bring on as many guys as you've got!

93
00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.460
Thunderbolt Tempo!

94
00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:48.840
Tiger Trap!

95
00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:51.050
Oni Giri!

96
00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.550
Pound Phoenix!

97
00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.310
Cien Fleur!

98
00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.590
Keep an eye on Straw Hat in the first column!

99
00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.940
Y-Yes, sir, but...

100
00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:14.580
Hm?

101
00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:19.650
The pirate Straw Hat Luffy
appears to be severely wounded!

102
00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:22.960
He isn't moving at all!

103
00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:25.590
What?!

104
00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.850
Hey, Luffy!

105
00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:38.800
What're you doing?!
Hurry and get your butt over here!

106
00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.690
We're as good as dead if we stay here!

107
00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.400
What's gotten into you?! We're so close!

108
00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.910
Use your Rubber Rubber and shoot yourself over here!

109
00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.240
I'll carry you the rest of the way!

110
00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.570
We're surrounded by the sea
and a bunch of battleships!

111
00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:06.090
If we stay here, we're goners!

112
00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:09.930
It seems that the pirates are trying
to escape aboard the escort ship.

113
00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.090
Yeah.

114
00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:14.050
Luffy!

115
00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:22.770
I-I can't.

116
00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:27.860
My body.

117
00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.070
What?

118
00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.030
It won't move at all.

119
00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.740
It won't move?

120
00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:43.290
Don't be ridiculous! You defeated the enemy!

121
00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:47.790
Robin's back too!
All we need to do now is leave!

122
00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.170
Please! Give it your all!

123
00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.180
Usopp!

124
00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:04.090
We're gonna take the ship over to Luffy's column.

125
00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:05.850
Everyone! Hurry aboard!

126
00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:07.900
Fire!

127
00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.200
No! Our escape ship!

128
00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:29.240
Oh, crap! Now it's hopeless.

129
00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:32.800
That ship was our only way outta here!

130
00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:43.270
Kokoro-san... Chimney... Gonbe... Chopper!

131
00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:52.020
O-Oh no.

132
00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:14.170
They survived somehow!

133
00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:15.920
Outta the way!

134
00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.270
Thank goodness!

135
00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:29.150
Sanji-kun! Where in the world have you been?!

136
00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:34.310
Sorry about that.
I had to take care of something.

137
00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:39.770
At any rate, we're in serious trouble here.

138
00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:41.660
Since getting back Robin-chan,

139
00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.870
I thought this area would be safe from attack. But the ship–

140
00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:49.830
This is as far as you go!
Release the old lady now and–

141
00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:51.880
Don't waste our time!

142
00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.880
Mermaid Kick!

143
00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:01.300
Fire.

144
00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:09.560
Now they're firing on their own people!

145
00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.440
Cut them off at the second column!

146
00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.810
Fire!

147
00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:19.210
Watch out! Run! Run!

148
00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:21.240
Fire!

149
00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:06.270
Dammit! Looks like they demolished the entire bridge.

150
00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:07.810
We're stuck on this column!

151
00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.110
We're out of options!

152
00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:12.670
No choice but to fight them all here and now!

153
00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:16.580
Are you nuts?! Each new wave of enemies is gonna be stronger than the last!

154
00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:20.590
Ready all cannons to fire on the first column!

155
00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:37.560
Eliminate Straw Hat Luffy immediately!

156
00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:47.240
Luffy!

157
00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:55.500
Luffy's in danger!
We need to at least get him over here!

158
00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:57.840
Oh, crap!

159
00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.010
Luffy!

160
00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.390
It won't work. At this distance,

161
00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:07.180
even if I try to pull him, I'll drop him into the sea.

162
00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.180
Luffy!

163
00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:12.610
This is bad. They're in a real pickle!

164
00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:16.570
Straw Hat won, but he can't stand up!
It seems like his life is in danger!

165
00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:17.440
What?!

166
00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:20.720
Straw Hat!

167
00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:25.030
Stand up, Straw Hat!

168
00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.340
Pull it together, kid!

169
00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.150
Pirate guy!

170
00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:32.660
Luffy! Stand up! Please!

171
00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:35.370
Isn't there something you can do, Luffy?!

172
00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.590
Luffy!

173
00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:37.810
Straw Hat!

174
00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:41.270
Straw Hat! You can do it!

175
00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:43.090
Straw Hat!

176
00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:50.180
Oh, crap. I'm in serious trouble!

177
00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.100
Again?

178
00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:56.520
Who is that?!

179
00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:02.270
Hey! Are you tryna get killed?!
This is no time to be spacing out!

180
00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.630
Just whose voice is this?

181
00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:10.240
Th-That's right! It's the same voice from before.

182
00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:20.230
What does this mean?!

183
00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:22.800
Straw Hat!

184
00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:25.050
It's obvious! It's my minions!

185
00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:29.180
No! Not those voices!
I've been hearing it for a while!

186
00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:30.590
Huh?!

187
00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:44.550
Below?

188
00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:48.350
Look below?

189
00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:03.670
Yeah, I do hear it. What? Below?

190
00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:10.010
Who's that?!

191
00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:13.100
What the hell is this?

192
00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:20.850
It's telling us to look below!

193
00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.980
What're you talking about, reindeer-chan?

194
00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:27.970
Ready the guns to fire at Straw Hat Luffy in the first column in five seconds!

195
00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:29.000
Luffy!

196
00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.650
Straw Hat!

197
00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:42.550
Jump into the sea!

198
00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:43.710
Four seconds!

199
00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:46.170
Into the sea!

200
00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:47.920
Usopp?!

201
00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:51.040
Robin, can you drop Luffy into the sea?

202
00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.010
Leave it to me!

203
00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.260
You idiot! Are you trying to get us to kill ourselves?!

204
00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.220
Something so drastic won't save us!

205
00:15:57.910 --> 00:15:59.180
Three!

206
00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:02.690
We're gonna be saved! She came to rescue us!

207
00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:06.570
We've got one more friend, remember?!

208
00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:08.530
Two!

209
00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.170
Chopper! Did you look below?!

210
00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.530
I did!

211
00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:18.240
Cien Fleur:

212
00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:25.920
One!

213
00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.450
Delphinium!

214
00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:31.760
I'm moving! Is Robin doing this?!

215
00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:40.520
Into the sea!

216
00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:47.770
Follow Luffy!

217
00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.730
Here we go!

218
00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.700
Here we go!

219
00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.530
Into the sea!

220
00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:59.750
The pirates are jumping into the sea!

221
00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:03.250
How stupid! There's no surviving these waters.

222
00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:06.430
Are they out of their minds?!

223
00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:22.670
Everyone, let's go back!

224
00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.940
Fire!

225
00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:43.200
Back to the seas of adventure!

226
00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:51.030
Jump on the Merry!

227
00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:57.190
Merry!

228
00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:00.830
I came to get you!

229
00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:05.170
What're they trying to pull?!

230
00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:07.710
Jumping into the sea is the last thing they should do!

231
00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:09.610
A few of them are also ability users!

232
00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.510
That's suicide!

233
00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.480
Hey, hold on a sec.

234
00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:16.070
What the heck is that?

235
00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:20.810
It's a ship! Judging by the Jolly Roger,
it's the Straw Hat Pirates' ship!

236
00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:23.540
How did it sneak past all our battleships undetected?

237
00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:45.470
I don't know who you are, but thanks...

238
00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:54.320
What the heck?

239
00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.510
Is something wrong, Sanji-kun?

240
00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:09.620
Hmm. Well, Nami-san,

241
00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:14.140
while the rope ladder definitely lowered,
there doesn't look to be anyone here.

242
00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:15.250
What?!

243
00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.590
Yay!

244
00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:22.390
Seriously. Learn how to swim, brother!

245
00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:27.310
Now, get on board, all of you with powers!

246
00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:30.350
Robin-chwan!

247
00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:34.530
Come fly into my arms!

248
00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:44.160
This is the Merry! It's the Merry!

249
00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.700
I really love the Merry!

250
00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.330
Merry. Merry!

251
00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.920
My Merry is alive!

252
00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:57.840
W-Why are you so...

253
00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:03.590
I-If I could... If only I could do more!

254
00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:08.810
I can't believe it!
This ship plummeted into the sea.

255
00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:24.890
Who could have sailed the ship here?

256
00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.230
We'll talk about it later!
Give us your instructions!

257
00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:27.950
You're right.

258
00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.370
Let's get out of here!

259
00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:31.450
Hey! What're you doing, Sanji-kun?!

260
00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:34.230
N-Nami-swan!

261
00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:39.670
That was close!
I thought those battleships were gonna kill me!

262
00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:43.050
Hey, Robin! You saved me! Thank y–

263
00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:54.100
Just leave the rest to us!

264
00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.630
Luffy... and everyone,

265
00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:10.580
thank you!

266
00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.590
Don't worry about it.

267
00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:31.520
You can say stupid stuff like that once we escape.

268
00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:34.520
What do you mean "stupid stuff," you damn Moss Head?!

269
00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.390
What do you mean, you damn Moss Head?!

270
00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:39.020
Shut up! If we die here,
none of this'll mean a damn thing!

271
00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.270
Apologize to Robin-chan, you bastard!

272
00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:43.740
He's right! Apologize to Robin!

273
00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:43.730
Give it a rest!

274
00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:45.110
Hm? Hey, Chopper!

275
00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.350
You can move now?

276
00:21:47.350 --> 00:21:48.450
What?

277
00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.310
Y-You're right! I'm moving!

278
00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:54.080
I can move now, Zoro!

279
00:21:54.490 --> 00:21:57.320
Apologize to Robin already!

280
00:21:57.320 --> 00:21:58.310
Give up yet?

281
00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:00.050
No! No!

282
00:22:00.970 --> 00:22:04.660
C'mon, guys! Let's hurry and get outta here!

283
00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:06.340
Yeah!

284
00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:10.440
Hey, hey! This is unacceptable!
Are you guys just letting them get away?!

285
00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:13.720
If they're going to escape,
might as well blow up Nico Robin after all!

286
00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:16.600
But we have to capture her alive!

287
00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:20.730
This is coming straight from Admiral Aokiji.

288
00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:22.570
All ships! Prepare to fire!

289
00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:25.550
F-From A-Admiral Aokiji?!

290
00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:27.270
Okay! Aim at them!

291
00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:32.270
All ships! Ready the guns to fire!
All ships! Ready the guns to fire!

292
00:22:34.230 --> 00:22:37.680
They fell for it.
I can't let them get away. They need to die.

293
00:22:37.680 --> 00:22:39.120
I'll just kill 'em all!

294
00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:44.980
Hey! Get the lead out and load the cannonballs!

295
00:22:44.980 --> 00:22:47.470
So Spandam is alive.

296
00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:49.220
They're gonna fire at us!

297
00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:51.220
Catch the wind from starboard and head east!

298
00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:53.160
We can't! We're completely surrounded!

299
00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:56.180
There're just too many cannons!

300
00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:59.640
They'll hit the ship for sure!

301
00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:00.900
Fire!

302
00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:05.900
Ahh! Here it comes!

303
00:23:10.190 --> 00:23:14.830
Hey, did those misfire?
None of their other attacks are hitting us either!

304
00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:17.660
Just where do you think you're all aiming?!

305
00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:20.570
There's something wrong!
It's like the cannons are aiming themselves!

306
00:23:20.570 --> 00:23:22.080
Don't give me a half-baked excuse!

307
00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:25.400
Stay clear!

308
00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:27.170
We can't! We're gonna collide!

309
00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:38.410
It's coming this way! What the hell is going on?!

310
00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:44.720
What's going on?! Give me a report!

311
00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:46.470
L-Look over there!

312
00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:49.110
What the hell?!

313
00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.930
The Gates of Justice suddenly began to close.

314
00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:55.850
Currents normally blocked
by the gates are producing whirlpools,

315
00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:57.210
and we've lost control of the rudder!

316
00:23:57.210 --> 00:23:59.400
So that explains our imprecise aim!

317
00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:00.870
Don't get swept up by the currents!

318
00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.500
Wh-What the hell is going on?

319
00:24:07.690 --> 00:24:09.600
Put out that fire! On the double!

320
00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:11.720
This is too much! Everyone, get out of here!

321
00:24:12.180 --> 00:24:16.050
Idiots! Why did you close the gates?
What did you morons think would happen?!

322
00:24:16.690 --> 00:24:20.330
The lever for the gates is
in the third column of the Bridge of Hesitation,

323
00:24:20.330 --> 00:24:21.650
so we couldn't have touched it!

324
00:24:21.650 --> 00:24:23.980
Whoa! This is better than I expected!

325
00:24:23.980 --> 00:24:26.490
Sanji! Don't tell me you did something earlier!

326
00:24:26.490 --> 00:24:27.020
Yep.

327
00:24:28.430 --> 00:24:31.400
Guts alone won't let us escape this kind of foe. Right?

328
00:24:36.810 --> 00:24:38.070
Bingo!

329
00:24:40.040 --> 00:24:42.540
Th-That's amazing, Sanji!

330
00:24:42.540 --> 00:24:43.500
Are you some kind of genius?!

331
00:24:44.030 --> 00:24:47.750
I hate to cut the celebrations short,
but the whirlpools are a problem for us too.

332
00:24:47.750 --> 00:24:49.460
Ahh! That's right! We're–

333
00:24:49.460 --> 00:24:51.920
Shut up, you guys!

334
00:24:53.530 --> 00:24:59.140
There wasn't a sea the Merry
couldn't cross with us on board!

335
00:24:59.140 --> 00:25:00.990
Ohhh!

336
00:25:00.990 --> 00:25:03.100
Nami-san! You're so cool!
That's right! We're counting on you, navigator!

337
00:25:03.580 --> 00:25:05.790
Just hold them off until I figure out
the trajectory of the whirlpools!

338
00:25:05.790 --> 00:25:06.940
Leave it to us!

339
00:25:15.330 --> 00:25:19.310
One-Sword Style: 36-Pound Phoenix!

340
00:25:22.230 --> 00:25:29.040
Dammit! Why?! Why can't you bring down
one puny little ship with seven battleships?!

341
00:25:29.040 --> 00:25:30.300
You useless morons!

342
00:25:31.110 --> 00:25:32.550
Hey, they're coming your way, Usopp!

343
00:25:32.570 --> 00:25:34.090
Okay! Leave them to me!

344
00:25:34.090 --> 00:25:36.290
I missed one! Sanji, take care of it!

345
00:25:36.290 --> 00:25:37.550
Basse Côte!

346
00:25:37.900 --> 00:25:42.020
Ahhh! I'm gonna fight too!

347
00:25:42.490 --> 00:25:44.890
You idiot! You can't move, can you?!

348
00:25:46.330 --> 00:25:48.980
He's right, Luffy. Leave this one to us...

349
00:25:49.540 --> 00:25:51.190
and take it easy!

350
00:25:55.610 --> 00:26:00.540
Ahhh! I don't care what you guys say;

351
00:26:00.540 --> 00:26:05.150
I'm gonna fight!

352
00:26:06.120 --> 00:26:10.020
I'll give a medal to the one
who actually hits them! So hurry up and hit them!

353
00:26:10.020 --> 00:26:12.550
All ships! Concentrate cannons on their ship's aft deck.

354
00:26:12.550 --> 00:26:14.130
Fire!

355
00:26:16.970 --> 00:26:20.800
Don't talk back! I'm your captain!

356
00:26:20.800 --> 00:26:21.680
Whoa!

357
00:26:34.530 --> 00:26:35.740
One...

358
00:26:35.740 --> 00:26:36.990
Two...

359
00:26:36.990 --> 00:26:38.910
Three!

360
00:26:38.910 --> 00:26:41.700
Not good! They're bouncing back our way!

361
00:26:47.330 --> 00:26:49.310
That saved us, Captain!

362
00:26:49.310 --> 00:26:51.330
Just what we'd expect from you, Captain!

363
00:26:51.330 --> 00:26:53.370
Hey! Are you guys demons?!

364
00:26:53.370 --> 00:26:54.250
Victory!

365
00:26:59.550 --> 00:27:02.510
I see it... the way to victory!

366
00:27:02.510 --> 00:27:05.610
Chopper, hard aport at 9 o'clock!

367
00:27:05.610 --> 00:27:06.980
O-Okay!

368
00:27:08.170 --> 00:27:10.980
The pirate ship escaped toward the falls!

369
00:27:10.980 --> 00:27:14.400
Fire! Fire! What're you doing?!

370
00:27:14.400 --> 00:27:17.440
Are you all idiots?! Sink that ship already!

371
00:27:17.830 --> 00:27:20.080
It seems they're using 
the natural flow of the whirlpools!

372
00:27:20.080 --> 00:27:21.410
Their speed is ludicrous!

373
00:27:21.410 --> 00:27:24.800
I'm gonna be useful too!

374
00:27:24.800 --> 00:27:27.250
Go for it, reindeer-chan!

375
00:27:27.250 --> 00:27:32.570
Go! Full speed ahead!

376
00:27:34.310 --> 00:27:38.300
Dammit! Dammit! Those bastards!

377
00:27:38.660 --> 00:27:41.890
With the entire military force
of Enies Lobby at our disposal...

378
00:27:42.300 --> 00:27:46.760
With the power of the buster call,
as strong as an entire country's military...

379
00:27:46.760 --> 00:27:50.730
Why... Why in the hell can't we...

380
00:27:50.730 --> 00:27:55.690
Why? Why can't we take a single woman...

381
00:27:57.230 --> 00:28:01.070
from a puny little band of pirates?!

382
00:28:26.270 --> 00:28:27.140
Chief!

383
00:28:34.350 --> 00:28:35.930
Help!

384
00:28:39.290 --> 00:28:40.780
Help.

385
00:28:43.170 --> 00:28:44.110
Clutch!

386
00:28:49.270 --> 00:28:51.040
C-Chief!

387
00:28:56.790 --> 00:29:01.630
Let's go, pirates! Let's go!

388
00:28:58.110 --> 00:29:00.390
All right, it's about time.

389
00:29:00.390 --> 00:29:01.630
Franky,

390
00:29:02.010 --> 00:29:03.590
could you do that thing?!

391
00:29:03.590 --> 00:29:04.380
Got it!

392
00:29:10.810 --> 00:29:13.100
Everyone, brace yourselves.

393
00:29:13.520 --> 00:29:17.110
Block their route! The enemy ship
can't get out of the whirlpools!

394
00:29:17.530 --> 00:29:21.190
This'll be rough on the ship. Sorry about that.

395
00:29:21.590 --> 00:29:24.330
Coup de Vent!

396
00:29:25.930 --> 00:29:28.530
Th-The pirate ship is flying!

397
00:29:29.160 --> 00:29:30.910
Is this really happening?!

398
00:29:30.910 --> 00:29:33.200
They've gone outside the fleet's range!

399
00:29:34.350 --> 00:29:37.130
Don't underestimate what she's been through!

400
00:29:37.130 --> 00:29:40.600
The Merry flew 10,000 meters high in the sky!

401
00:29:40.600 --> 00:29:43.510
Lethal Super Smoke Star!

402
00:29:47.950 --> 00:29:49.140
It's a smokescreen!

403
00:29:55.450 --> 00:29:56.720
Those bastards!

404
00:29:56.720 --> 00:29:58.600
After them! We bow to nobody in speed!

405
00:29:58.970 --> 00:30:01.600
We can't! We're caught in the whirlpools!

406
00:30:01.600 --> 00:30:03.190
It's taking everything we've got just to stay afloat!

407
00:30:10.390 --> 00:30:12.240
Fire! Fire!

408
00:30:43.130 --> 00:30:45.360
It seems that Straw Hat and
the others were able to escape!

409
00:30:45.860 --> 00:30:48.240
All right! We'll head back too!

410
00:30:59.750 --> 00:31:04.530
Go, Puffing Tom!

411
00:31:11.670 --> 00:31:15.140
We'll still pursue them.

412
00:31:15.610 --> 00:31:18.130
We can't possibly let it end like this.

413
00:31:18.130 --> 00:31:22.230
To maintain our dignity as the Navy—
no, as the World Government—

414
00:31:22.660 --> 00:31:26.230
we'll bring down the Straw Hat Pirates,

415
00:31:26.230 --> 00:31:30.030
and we'll capture Nico Robin,
the most dangerous criminal, without fail!

416
00:31:30.030 --> 00:31:34.350
Therefore, we require fleet reinforcements and additional marines–

417
00:31:34.350 --> 00:31:35.330
Don't bother.

418
00:31:35.330 --> 00:31:36.470
But–

419
00:31:36.470 --> 00:31:39.600
We used a buster call,
an attack as strong as entire nations.

420
00:31:39.600 --> 00:31:43.800
When you look at the blunder
this fleet made and the current state...

421
00:31:43.800 --> 00:31:47.300
of Enies Lobby, the very symbol of law,
it's quite apparent.

422
00:31:48.490 --> 00:31:52.260
This battle ends in our utter defeat.

423
00:31:53.530 --> 00:31:56.150
Is the top of this ram's head here okay?

424
00:31:56.150 --> 00:31:58.930
Yep. That's my seat.

425
00:31:58.930 --> 00:32:02.550
There you go. Be careful not to fall.

426
00:32:03.210 --> 00:32:05.900
Yeah. Thanks, old monster lady.

427
00:32:08.570 --> 00:32:10.310
Thanks, Merry.

428
00:32:10.310 --> 00:32:12.360
Thanks to you, we were able to escape.

429
00:32:13.150 --> 00:32:16.450
I never would've imagined that you'd come, Merry.

430
00:32:16.450 --> 00:32:20.830
But when I think about it,
you've always protected us.

431
00:32:21.240 --> 00:32:23.790
I'm so glad that you're our friend.

432
00:32:24.400 --> 00:32:26.890
Thanks, Merry!

433
00:32:26.890 --> 00:32:28.790
At any rate,

434
00:32:29.330 --> 00:32:32.260
you guys sure did pull one outrageous stunt back there.

435
00:32:32.260 --> 00:32:37.190
To start with, who would've guessed that
you'd shoot the World Government's flag!

436
00:32:37.190 --> 00:32:40.610
Well, it's not a big deal.

437
00:32:41.510 --> 00:32:46.650
All we did was take back a friend
who was taken from us.

438
00:32:47.590 --> 00:32:50.610
Thanks for helping us save Robin.

439
00:32:51.530 --> 00:32:56.570
Well, y'know, it was no big deal.

440
00:32:57.670 --> 00:32:59.160
Anyway,

441
00:32:59.160 --> 00:33:00.040
we claim...

442
00:33:01.250 --> 00:33:03.330
this fight...

443
00:33:03.330 --> 00:33:06.250
as a win!

444
00:33:06.250 --> 00:33:09.040
Yeah!
